with six months of chemo,

00:46:00.790 --> 00:46:04.140
but I stayed in school and
decided I was gonna continue

00:46:04.140 --> 00:46:06.780
commuting back and forth
to Jersey, or New York,

00:46:06.780 --> 00:46:10.200
to do chemo at Sloan Kettering

00:46:10.200 --> 00:46:12.030
because I didn't wanna stop college.

00:46:12.030 --> 00:46:13.340
I didn't wanna leave my friends.

00:46:13.340 --> 00:46:15.460
I didn't wanna move back home.

00:46:15.460 --> 00:46:18.280
So, it wasn't until a few
years ago when we decided

00:46:18.280 --> 00:46:20.250
before we decided to write the book,

00:46:20.250 --> 00:46:24.410
that I was kind of woken up by Sampson.

00:46:24.410 --> 00:46:25.560
