It's sort of having your
own mantra, I think.

00:48:41.500 --> 00:48:43.570
And whatever you're going through life

00:48:43.570 --> 00:48:45.590
and where you're going
you need that motivation,

00:48:45.590 --> 00:48:48.050
that constant reminder
to keep pushing yourself.

00:48:48.050 --> 00:48:50.140
And it should be something very simple.

