And I feel like that is ironclad

00:48:55.420 --> 00:48:57.000
and it can help you to sort of

00:48:57.000 --> 00:48:57.960
get you to where you're going.

00:48:57.960 --> 00:49:00.040
Cause we are all on this
sort of journey in life.

