What are you gonna do with
that dash in the middle?

00:49:27.160 --> 00:49:28.590
- So you have to stay motivated

00:49:28.590 --> 00:49:30.217
and you have to find that drive--

00:49:30.217 --> 00:49:31.050
- You know, something?

00:49:31.050 --> 00:49:32.290
I apologize, I don't know
why that just hit me, sorry,

00:49:32.290 --> 00:49:34.450
something I didn't I haven't
shared with my audience

00:49:34.450 --> 00:49:36.550
or really, even a lot of
people, I think the team knows.

00:49:36.550 --> 00:49:40.040
My grandmother passed away
four or five weeks ago

00:49:40.040 --> 00:49:42.510
and I've talked about my
grandma publicly here and there

00:49:42.510 --> 00:49:44.200
about like being a tough kind of character

00:49:44.200 --> 00:49:45.810
and like having empathy for my dad.

